# Build context allowlist for tools/worker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this
# file instead of the repo's .dockerignore for that Dockerfile). The tools'
# target/, models/, ref*/ and test media are many GB and never needed.
*
!tools/loki-*/Cargo.toml
!tools/loki-*/Cargo.lock
!tools/loki-*/build.rs
!tools/loki-*/src
!tools/loki-*/kernels
!tools/loki-*/assets
!tools/loki-*/docs
!tools/loki-*/tests
!media-server/go.mod
!media-server/go.sum
!media-server/workerapi
!media-server/cmd/loki-worker
!tools/worker/prebuilt
